  "prefLabel": "En 902.11 Electric assistance program low-moderate income group member",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.11 “Electric assistance program low-moderate income group member” means residents who have enrolled in or are on the waitlist for the state electric assistance program and are selected by the administering utility to be enrolled in an EAP LMI community solar project. EAP LMI participant information cannot be shared with hosts and will be overseen by the administering utility. Selected participants do not need to take any action to participate in a project. They will be notified of enrollment by their utility and may opt out of a project at any time.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en900.html"
